{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1287076-mage-the-podcast-update-mage-wraith-crossover-information","id":1287076,"title":"Mage: The Podcast update, Mage/Wraith Crossover Information","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-02-12T09:29:15-08:00","id":1287076,"title":"Mage: The Podcast update, Mage/Wraith Crossover Information","content":"<br /> Mage the podcast has switched service providers and we weren't able to switch the RSSs for all of our providers before zcast closed. If you'd like to subscribe or resubscribe, we're here:<br /> <br /> If you prefer episodes one at a time: <a href=\"https://magethepodcast.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://magethepodcast.com/</a><br /> If you want the RSS feed: <a href=\"https://anchor.fm/s/87f7e2c/podcast/rss\" target=\"_blank\">https://anchor.fm/s/87f7e2c/podcast/rss</a><br /> <br /> Mage the Podcast Season 2 has started publishing and our first three episodes are:<br /> * Discussion with Victor Kinzer, author of A Phoenix Rises, a chronicle quickstart available on drivethrurpg: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/265482/A-Phoenix-Rising?affiliate_id=1405025\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.storytellersvault.com/pr...ate_id=1405025</a><br /> *Two hours on the glory of Digital Web 1.0 (<a href=\"https://anchor.fm/mage-the-podcast/episodes/Tomes-of-Magick-Digital-Web-e33cg6\" target=\"_blank\">https://anchor.fm/mage-the-podcast/e...tal-Web-e33cg6</a>)<br /> *Talking Wraith/Mage crossovers with <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/758-ramnesis\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar758_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"758\" data-vbnamecard=\"758\">Ramnesis</a> of the Geekly Oddcast (<a href=\"https://anchor.fm/mage-the-podcast/episodes/Worlds-of-Darkness-MageWraith-Crossovers-e34so8\" target=\"_blank\">https://anchor.fm/mage-the-podcast/e...ssovers-e34so8</a>)<br /> <br /> I have four or five episodes ready for the next month. If you have a mic and play Mage and would like to discuss something you feel you do particularly well, an area that's ignored or that many find confusing, you've written a ST Vault supplement and want to discuss it, or you want to get in a screaming match over something, drop me a line!<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15603-phillycuriosity","name":"PhillyCuriosity","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15603_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-13T10:27:35-08:00","id":1287580,"title":"","content":"Woo! Thanks for the heads up!<br /> I didn't know this podcast existed, and now I got all the episodes popped into my player.<br /> Nice to see that the podcast also had quite an interesting startoff in its first episode <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Very worth listening to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-14T08:49:13-08:00","id":1287956,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ambrosia</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1287076-mage-the-podcast-update-mage-wraith-crossover-information?p=1287580#post1287580\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Woo! Thanks for the heads up!<br /> I didn't know this podcast existed, and now I got all the episodes popped into my player.<br /> Nice to see that the podcast also had quite an interesting startoff in its first episode <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Very worth listening to.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh thank you. Joseph (the producer and founder) has a penchant to swing for the fences. I didn't get involved until something like episode 25. Always appreciate feedback and I hope you find it justifies your listening time.","signature":""